                    "editor": "<figure class=\"gp-case-evidence\"><img src=\"{{asset:luma-final-800.webp}}\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Final Luma the Sleepy Star cover, by John Capon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"{{asset:luma-final-480.webp}} 480w, {{asset:luma-final-800.webp}} 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), 520px\"><figcaption>Final front-cover artwork from the project case study. The supplied story illustrations were not created as part of this work.</figcaption></figure><dl class=\"gp-case-facts\"><div><dt>Author / client</dt><dd>John Capon</dd></div><div><dt>Genre</dt><dd>Children’s picture book</dd></div><div><dt>Trim size</dt><dd>8.5 × 8.5 inches</dd></div><div><dt>Final interior</dt><dd>35 pages</dd></div><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Paperback print package</dd></div><div><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>8 October 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Intended platform</dt><dd>Amazon KDP</dd></div><div><dt>Work completed</dt><dd>Cover redesign and interior formatting</dd></div></dl>"
