                  "id": "1fb60e1a",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<ul><li>A full paperback cover wrap with coordinated front, spine and back-cover presentation.</li><li>A 35-page formatted interior, including ownership and title pages.</li><li>Final cover and interior print PDFs, with embedded fonts in the interior.</li><li>Bleed-ready interior pages measuring 8.625 × 8.75 inches for the agreed 8.5 × 8.5-inch trim.</li></ul><figure class=\"gp-case-evidence\"><img src=\"{{asset:luma-cover-wrap-1280.webp}}\" width=\"1280\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Final full paperback cover wrap for Luma the Sleepy Star, showing back cover, spine and front cover\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"{{asset:luma-cover-wrap-760.webp}} 760w, {{asset:luma-cover-wrap-1280.webp}} 1280w, {{asset:luma-cover-wrap-1900.webp}} 1900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\"><figcaption>Final paperback cover wrap, reproduced from the project PDF, page 3.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gp-case-evidence\"><img src=\"{{asset:luma-interior-spread-1400.webp}}\" width=\"1400\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Finished Luma interior spread with a readable text page beside a supplied story illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"{{asset:luma-interior-spread-720.webp}} 720w, {{asset:luma-interior-spread-1400.webp}} 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\"><figcaption>Finished interior example from the project PDF, page 4. Illustration supplied with the manuscript; formatting completed within this project.</figcaption></figure>"
                  },
