                },
                {
                  "id": "72d02da0",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p>The observable outcome was a coordinated paperback cover and formatted interior, delivered on 8 October 2026. The supplied 33-page layout/manuscript became a 35-page print interior with the added front matter. The final PDFs brought the cover and reading layout together as a print package.</p><p><strong>This project ended at file delivery.</strong> It did not include KDP upload, publication, metadata optimisation or Kindle conversion. Amazon KDP was the intended platform, not evidence of a completed upload or platform approval.</p><p>The story illustrations were supplied. No sales, ranking or advertising results are claimed, and the design decisions are not presented as a measured increase in readability or commercial performance.</p><p>John Capon’s existing review is preserved on <a href=\"{{url:feedback}}\">Client Feedback</a>.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
