                    "editor": "<p><a href=\"{{url:cover-design}}\">Book Cover Design</a> and <a href=\"{{url:book-formatting}}\">Book Formatting</a> reflect the work completed on Luma. If account setup or upload work is needed after file delivery, <a href=\"{{url:publishing-support}}\">Publishing Support</a> is a separate scope to agree.</p><p><a class=\"gp-button gp-button-secondary\" href=\"{{asset:luma-sleepy-star-case-study.pdf}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the original case study PDF <span class=\"gpc-sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></p><p class=\"gp-small\">PDF · 7 pages · 2.44 MiB (2,562,805 bytes)</p><p class=\"gp-small\">Source: the supplied Luma the Sleepy Star case-study PDF, including the earlier cover direction, final cover wrap, interior examples and delivery record.</p>"
